Package: ooiptables
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: IPTABLES SHIM
 Compatibility shim translating iptables commands into openOODA nftables rules.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
